Spec: UI Module

Purpose:
  React components for the application interface — toolbar, header,
  properties panel, sidebar, rulers, toast notifications, and dialogs.

Structure:
  ./Header.tsx: Top bar with global actions
  ./Toolbar.tsx: Left vertical tool palette
  ./RightSidebar.tsx: Properties and Library tabs
  ./PropertiesPanel.tsx: Context-sensitive shape properties
  ./OffsetPanel.tsx: Offset tool configuration
  ./Ruler.tsx: Horizontal and vertical mm rulers
  ./ShortcutHelp.tsx: Keyboard shortcut overlay
  ./Toast.tsx: Notification and confirmation dialog system
  ./components/: Reusable UI primitives (Button, NumberInput)

Owns:
  ./*.tsx
  ./components/**

Must:
  All interactive elements have aria-label attributes.
  Buttons with icon-only content have accessible names.
  Toast notifications used for all user feedback (not alert/confirm).
  Properties panel is context-sensitive (changes based on selection/tool).
  All inputs accept mm values and convert to pixels internally.
  Theme colors come from centralized ThemeColors (no duplicated interfaces).
  Ruler dynamically adjusts tick spacing based on zoom level.

Must not:
  Contain business logic — delegate to commands/store.
  Use native alert() or confirm() dialogs.
  Duplicate ThemeColors interface (import from config/themes.ts).
  Call setShapes() directly (use commands for undoable changes).

Depends on:
  @useStore
  @ThemeColors
  @CanvasController (for tool switching and command execution)
  @notify / @confirmDialog (from Toast.tsx)
